      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Pelvic schwannoma is a rare cause of sciatic pain. We report a case of retroperitoneal pelvic schwannoma presenting with chronic sciatica which was diagnosed and monitored radiologically for several years before successful surgical resection."},
